- **C1 — RESOLVED.** Literals are pinned at [depth_canon_launch.sh:69](/home/yixunhu/codespace/exp-25-depth-canon/worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_25_depth_canon_claude/depth_canon_launch.sh:69), [depth_canon_launch.sh:73](/home/yixunhu/codespace/exp-25-depth-canon/worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_25_depth_canon_claude/depth_canon_launch.sh:73), and [depth_canon_launch.sh:76](/home/yixunhu/codespace/exp-25-depth-canon/worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_25_depth_canon_claude/depth_canon_launch.sh:76), with the policy self-check at line 86. Watcher equality is asserted at [test_depth_canon_autolaunch.py:495](/home/yixunhu/codespace/exp-25-depth-canon/src/tests/test_depth_canon_autolaunch.py:495). Twelve GiB leaves about 1.7 GiB above the measured 10.3 GiB/card peak; defensible as an admission floor, not a reservation. A 120 h cap is sane against ≈43 h uncontended and ≈86 h at half rate.

